90 percent of fraud) include email or phone one-time password, or O.T.P., device fingerprinting, and I.P.

33
00:06:22.153 --> 00:06:22.153
geolocation. Enhanced verification (higher trust, higher rewards) include government electronic identification, or e-I.D.,

34
00:06:22.153 --> 00:06:22.153
integration (Estonia, India Aadhaar, E.U. electronic Identification, Authentication and Trust Services, or E.I.D.A.S., U.S.

35
00:06:22.153 --> 00:06:22.153
via I.D. dot me), biometric liveness detection, and proof-of-uniqueness partners (Worldcoin, BrightID, Gitcoin Passport).

36
00:06:22.153 --> 00:06:22.153
Social verification includes community attestation for people without digital I.D.s.

37
00:06:22.153 --> 00:06:22.153
Even Layer 1 gets you counted. You don't need a passport to say "I would prefer not to die."

38
00:06:22.153 --> 00:06:22.153
A.I. fraud detection catches edge cases: greater than ninety-nine percent detection, and one point zero (each person brings

39
